{
  "title": "Postgres — Top 15 + Slow Queries",
  "uid": "agent-core-postgres-top10",
  "description": "Curated from the ~360 raw postgres_exporter series under job=\"postgres\" (see Grafana Drilldown > Metrics — most of that count is static pg_settings_* config values and the exporter's own Go runtime stats, not operational signal) down to the 15 that DBA/ops teams actually watch: availability, connection saturation, transaction throughput, long-running/idle-in-transaction sessions, lock contention, cache effectiveness, storage growth, row-level I/O, error/rollback rate, deadlocks, checkpoint health, buffer-writer balance, and temp-file spillage — plus slow-query (pg_stat_statements) and missing-index-proxy (pg_stat_user_tables) panels at the bottom. The 10 panels backed by per-database metrics (langfuse/litellm/appdata/checkpointer/postgres) filter via the Database dropdown above; pg_up, Connection saturation, WAL size, Checkpoints/hour, and Buffers written are whole-instance metrics with no per-database breakdown to filter. The slow-query and missing-index panels only ever see appdata (postgres-exporter's DATA_SOURCE_NAME) — see that service's own comment in docker-compose.yml for why.",
  "schemaVersion": 42,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "tags": [
    "agent-core-demo",
    "postgres"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "database",
        "label": "Database",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(pg_stat_database_numbackends, datname)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(pg_stat_database_numbackends, datname)",
          "refId": "PrometheusDatasource-VariableQuery"
        },
        "regex": "/^(?!template).*/",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
