    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connection saturation",
      "description": "100 * sum(pg_stat_database_numbackends) / pg_settings_max_connections (max_connections is 100 in this dev deployment) — headroom before new connections start failing outright. Computed with sum by (instance)(...) / on(instance) rather than a plain division: the raw sum() strips every label including instance/job, and Prometheus refuses to match a fully label-less vector against one that still carries them — the naive query silently returns no data instead of erroring.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * sum by (instance) (pg_stat_database_numbackends) / on(instance) pg_settings_max_connections",
          "legendFormat": "% of max_connections",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 14
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Transactions/sec — commit & rollback",
      "description": "sum(rate(pg_stat_database_xact_commit[5m])) / sum(rate(pg_stat_database_xact_rollback[5m])), scoped by the Database filter above — overall write throughput and, via the rollback series, an early read on application-level error/retry volume. Kept as one aggregate line per series (not split per-database) to avoid the dropdown's \"All\" view turning into a wall of lines; pick a specific database to see just its throughput.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(pg_stat_database_xact_commit{datname=~\"$database\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "commits/sec",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(pg_stat_database_xact_rollback{datname=~\"$database\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rollbacks/sec",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
