    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Row I/O",
      "description": "sum(rate(pg_stat_database_tup_{fetched,inserted,updated,deleted}[5m])), scoped by the Database filter above — row-level read/write activity. Fetched dominating (reads) vs inserted/updated/deleted (writes) shows at a glance whether this Postgres is serving a read-heavy or write-heavy workload right now. Kept as 4 aggregate lines rather than 4×database to stay readable — narrow with the Database dropdown to isolate one app's row activity.",
