      "description": "topk(10, pg_stat_user_tables_seq_tup_read) — tables ranked by cumulative rows read via sequential scan. This is the actionable \"cost of a missing index\" signal: a seq scan on a 10-row table is free, a seq scan reading millions of rows repeatedly is the one worth indexing. Only sees appdata (postgres-exporter's DATA_SOURCE_NAME) — verified directly that --auto-discover-databases does not route this collector to the other application databases on this exporter version, despite the exporter's own docs describing it that way; see docker-compose.yml's postgres-exporter service comment.",
